{102}{It's a standoff, laddie. They've learned just how close they can get without gettin' shot, and my ol' huntin' bow does a pretty good job of keepin' 'em outta witchin' range. So here we stand. Are you here to help?}{It's a standoff, lassie. They've learned just how close they can get without gettin' shot, and my ol' huntin' bow does a pretty good job of keepin' 'em outta witchin' range. So here we stand. Are you here to help?}{}{}{}{}
