{113}{Glad to have you, sir! As you can see, they're trapped in the tanglewood. The high water is keepin' them on the island, but in a few more days, the water level will drop enough to let them walk across the shallows. }{Glad to have you, lady! The high water is keepin' them on the island, but in a few more days, the water level will drop enough to let them walk across the shallows.}{}{}{}{}
{114}{I see. Anything else?}{}{5}{}{115}{}
{115}{Yeah... They're smart! Problem solvin' smart. I've been watchin' that one over there for days and when she looks at me, I can tell she's studying the situation and figuring out just how much longer it'll be before they can come swarmin' outta there. Never underestimate 'em, laddie.}{Yeah... They're smart! Problem solvin' smart. I've been watchin' that one over there for days and when she looks at me, I can tell she's studying the situation and figuring out just how much longer it'll be before they can come swarmin' outta there. Never underestimate 'em, lassie.}{}{}{}{}
{116}{I won't. Let's just hope they underestimate us.}{}{5}{}{117}{}
