{160}{Aye... I have. There's this story from way back when about how this human woman who wanted to live forever made a deal with a demon. She got her wish but she became a demon herself. He turned her into a spider - because she was a weaver-woman, you see - but she has the power to make people see her as a beautiful woman.}{Aye... I have. There's this story from way back when about how this human woman who wanted to live forever made a deal with a demon. She got her wish but she became a demon herself. He turned her into a spider - because she was a weaver-woman, you see - but she has the power to make people see her as a beautiful woman.}{}{}{}{}
