{164}{Any how, when she finds a place out in the middle of nowhere; a farm or hamlet; she'll come to the door in the early evening and make the people think she's just a human woman who's out seeing the sights, and got lost. They'll offer her some refreshment or maybe even a place to sleep for the night, but she's actually sizin' them up as a source of food for her young.}{Any how, when she finds a place out in the middle of nowhere; a farm or hamlet; she'll come to the door in the early evening and make the people think she's just a human woman who's out seeing the sights, and got lost. They'll offer her some refreshment or maybe even a place to sleep for the night, but she's actually sizin' them up as a source of food for her young.}{}{}{}{}
